ity at the same time (that is, to the extent that the tester can test). The exception was partitioning and replication, which should be done exactly the way Dynamo does.","topics":[],"score":211297,"global_rank":265491},{"name":"Venkteshkavi/Algorithms-DataStructures-Efficient-Practices","owner":"Venkteshkavi","html_url":"https://github.com/Venkteshkavi/Algorithms-DataStructures-Efficient-Practices","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This repository contains some interesting leetcode and programming problems","topics":[],"score":211297,"global_rank":265492},{"name":"sjdallst/KTPAndroid","owner":"sjdallst","html_url":"https://github.com/sjdallst/KTPAndroid","stars":0,"forks":2,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"Android App for Kappa Theta Pi, a professional technology fraternity ","topics":[],"score":211296,"global_rank":265523},{"name":"JulinaM/neo4j-procedure","owner":"JulinaM","html_url":"https://github.com/JulinaM/neo4j-procedure","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Java","description":"Procedures for neo4j cypher query","topics":[],"score":211283,"global_rank":265571},{"name":"prasanth50/fundamental","owner":"prasanth50","html_url":"https://github.com/prasanth50/fundamental","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211283,"global_rank":265587},{"name":"prasanth50/fundamentals-","owner":"prasanth50","html_url":"https://github.com/prasanth50/fundamentals-","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211283,"global_rank":265588}]